{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>林凱恩早前她把握假期遠赴內蒙古旅遊，期間特意換上當地的特色民族服飾，化身「草原公主」，並大晒多張極具意境的絕美靚相，留言寫道：「《內蒙古明信片》🤎」</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"a8813635-f605-4f99-8bbc-f1723c6edca2.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026ooeiJZN9C91791859508.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>相片中，林凱恩戴上精緻的毛茸頭飾，穿上色彩鮮艷且花紋華麗的民族長袍，於廣闊的草原上擺出多個造型。她不僅親切地依偎在駿馬身旁、抱著可愛的小白羊合照，又在經幡下閉目合十，充滿濃厚的異域風情。</p><p></p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"439b6a49-3d54-4d2f-8c78-83d1f72015d6.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026c6rCGnSgwU1791859508.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"49149797-86ab-4dbf-92ec-d70678bee86e.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026KuEcC9UoPV1791859506.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>這組質感滿滿的靚相曝光後，隨即引來大批網民及圈中好友圍觀留言，大讚她「造型太美了」、「簡直係真·草原公主」、「每張相都好似明信片咁靚」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T03:40:49.161192+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T02:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T05:17:56.577346+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T03:37:57.314532+00:00","content_hash":"ddfdf0f354652945e504ca735fbae25e7d378e518681aab7e08fccb199e61016","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}